Herald Vanderbloom was the first of the husk dead in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He belonged to the famous Vanderbloom family only by blood test, a third cousin of a branch family, and had no money to his name. He cared nothing for magical artifacts and was averagely religious.

A neighbour across the hall said that the day before he died Vanderbloom met someone in a strange burlap tunic.
